           "text": "Logo Design Services for Round Rock, TX",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Round Rock sits just north of Austin along I-35 in Williamson County, and it is one of the areas where Logo Austin works with clients most often. Round Rock has a large base of family-owned shops, home-service contractors and technology businesses, so a logo there often needs to look professional to corporate buyers while staying approachable for neighborhood customers.</p><p>Projects are handled entirely by phone, text and email from the Logo Austin office in North Austin, so Round Rock owners don't need to drive into the city.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
