           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Branding Tips for Round Rock Businesses",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>Round Rock has many businesses in similar categories; choose colors that differ from nearby competitors.</li><li>If you sell to larger companies in the area, keep a clean, corporate version of your logo.</li><li>Make sure your Google Business Profile icon is legible; many Round Rock customers search on mobile.</li><li>Plan versions for vehicle graphics if you serve homes across Williamson County.</li></ul>",
