          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do you design logos for businesses in Round Rock, TX?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Round Rock is one of the areas Logo Austin serves most often. Projects are handled by phone, text and email from the Austin office.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can I get my Round Rock business logo the same day?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>In most cases, yes. Logo Austin usually sends multiple concepts within hours of receiving your business name and vision.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a custom logo cost for a Round Rock business?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin charges $125 to $175 for a custom logo, with no upfront payment. You pay only after approving the final design and receive JPG, PNG, SVG, PDF, AI and EPS files.</p>",
